   "Scattered neighborhoods feel far apart, and you, Tom, have a plan: a Friendship Festival on wheels.",
   "Collect golden Spark Tokens, charge your boost, and invite PATCH, REEL, PING and LOOP to race.",
   "Three friendly races, three laps each. No combat, just heart. Time to find your people."
  ],
  "levelIntros": [
   "Neighborhood Loop: Sunny porches and corner shops. Wave to every block, Tom, and gather the first friends.",
   "Creator Coast: Turquoise waves and coastal ramps. Catch air with a smile, Tom, and link the shore crews.",
   "Festival Circuit: Sapphire and gold lights plus fireworks. Take the safe left or speedy right fork, Tom!"
  ],
  "victory": [
   "The Festival Circuit glows gold as you, Tom, cross the line with friends all around.",
   "Every neighborhood is linked at last. Your people were here all along."
  ]
 },
